# Marks 'shared' as a valid recipient in the bbs.local virtual mailbox
# domain, so RCPT TO:<shared> is accepted at SMTP time -- Postfix rejects
# any recipient in a virtual_mailbox_domain that isn't listed in
# virtual_mailbox_maps/virtual_alias_maps, regardless of transport_maps.
# The value itself is never used for actual delivery: transport_maps
# (see virtual-shared-transport) routes 'shared' mail to the pipe/safecat
# transport instead of letting the virtual(8) agent write it directly
# (virtual(8) hardcodes delivered files at mode 0600, incompatible with
# this mailbox's world-readable design -- see deliver-shared).
shared	shared/
